# 20. Entertainment Areas

Entertainment configurations should be discovered and represented in Aura even if real-time streaming is not yet enabled.

Version 1 may expose:

- Entertainment area name
- Assigned lights
- Associated room
- Availability
- Suggested activity integration

Future support may include:

- TV light sync
- Gaming sync
- Music visualization
- Low-latency streaming

Entertainment streaming requires a separate performance and security design and should not be implemented as ordinary REST command traffic.

